<title>USA: CapMAC Holdings Inc Q4 shr $0.39 vs $0.49.</title>
<headline>CapMAC Holdings Inc Q4 shr $0.39 vs $0.49.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr net		   $ 0.39		  $  0.49</p>
<p> Shr oper		    0.46		     0.45</p>
<p> Net			  7,100		    7,200</p>
<p> Oper			 8,300		    6,600</p>
<p> Revs			   n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,600		   12,300</p>
<p>	 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr net		  $  1.92		   $ 1.73</p>
<p> Shr oper		    1.99		     1.66</p>
<p> Net			 33,568		   23,528</p>
<p> Oper			   n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Revs			83,979		   62,632</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,600		   12,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Pre-tax net realized capital losses for full-year 1996 were $1.8 million, compared with pre-tax net realized capital gains of $1.4 million in full-year 1995. In the fourth quarter of 1996, CapMAC Holdings realized a pre-tax capital loss of $2 million, which represents a partial write-off of the approximately $11 million that CapMAC is committed to invest in the TMG Group, subsidiaries of The Mutual Life Assurance Co of Canada.</p>
<p>The difference in share numbers between 1995 and 1996 was caused by an initial public offering.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
</text>
